~ start

The Pork:  Welcome traveller! No time to talk, [wave amp=25 freq=5]giant bugs[/wave] are attacking our beautiful town!
The Pork: The guard is too lazy to help. [shake rate=20 level=10]Please help us![/shake]

- What can I do to help? 
	The Pork: Go into the first area and mess up as many bugs as you can.
	The Pork: Use W A S D to control the character and your mouse to control the gun. Use the left mouse button to shoot! Don't forget to press "M" on your keyboard to switch your default weapon.
	The Pork: The bugs will drop [wave amp=25 freq=5]coins[/wave] and sometimes [wave amp=25 freq=5]pork[/wave]. The pork will heal you! 
	The Pork: Once you accumulate[wave amp=25 freq=5] 20[/wave] coins, proceed to the next area.
	The Pork: Once you get[wave amp=25 freq=5] 300 [/wave]coins, talk to the guard for a surprise!
	The pork: Don't be afraid to faint, you'll be carried back here. 
	
	
- Goodbye!
	The Pork: [shake rate=20 level=10]Please save the town![/shake]

=> END!
